{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-634915819054236435 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=634915818953507603&sectionId=634915819054236435)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHgdpFk1JX_text","label":"ggHgdpFk1JX_text","default":"The Gift They Will Want to Show Everyone"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAEaSgT18i_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggAEaSgT18i_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/518ace4e-7951-4780-afa7-4f362235d122.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy1bllNyNr_text","label":"ggy1bllNyNr_text","default":"<p>There is a special kind of excitement that happens when someone receives a gift and immediately wants to show it to somebody else. Maybe it is because the gift is unusual, maybe it reminds them of a favorite moment, or maybe they simply cannot believe that an ordinary photograph has been turned into something completely different.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That reaction is what makes a gift memorable. Instead of being something that quietly becomes another item in the house, it becomes something people want to talk about, explain, and share.</p><p>A personalized Memobrick can create that kind of reaction by taking a photograph that already has meaning and turning it into a brick mosaic that feels entirely new.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxSH6D-B6E_text","label":"ggxSH6D-B6E_text","default":"When a Familiar Photo Becomes Something Unexpected"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbYXQJkaEx_text","label":"ggbYXQJkaEx_text","default":"<p>Most of us have hundreds or even thousands of photographs stored on our phones. We take pictures during vacations, celebrations, ordinary weekends, family gatherings, and random moments that seemed worth capturing at the time. Many of those photographs are rarely seen again.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Turning one of them into a Memobrick changes that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The recipient may recognize the photograph immediately, but the brick mosaic gives them a completely different way to look at it. Instead of scrolling past the image on a screen, they can see it transformed into something physical that they can build and eventually display.</p><p>That transformation alone can make people curious.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwpvVuN5GH_text","label":"ggwpvVuN5GH_text","default":"A Gift That Creates Questions"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkgPuwBygs_text","label":"ggkgPuwBygs_text","default":"<p>Some of the best reactions to an unusual gift are questions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>How did you make this?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Is that our old photograph?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>How long did it take?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Can I see the original picture?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Where are you going to put it?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those questions are a sign that the gift has captured someone's attention. A Memobrick can naturally create that curiosity because the finished mosaic combines something recognizable with a format people may not expect.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It can also make the recipient want to explain the story behind the photograph. Once they start talking about where it came from, who was there, or why the moment was important, the gift becomes more than something they received.</p><p>It becomes a conversation piece.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGXZ7YumrL_text","label":"ggGXZ7YumrL_text","default":"<p>A personalized gift does not have to stay inside a drawer or closet after the celebration is over. One of the advantages of turning a meaningful photograph into wall art is that it can become part of the space where the recipient lives.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A favorite travel photograph might become a reminder of an unforgettable destination. A family picture can become something everyone sees when they walk through the house. A pet portrait can become a permanent tribute to a beloved companion. A vehicle photograph can fit naturally into a garage, office, or hobby space.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The display itself can become part of the story because visitors may notice the piece and ask about it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6DeOkdcmM_text","label":"gg6DeOkdcmM_text","default":"<p>There is another reason a Memobrick can stand out as a gift: the recipient can participate in creating it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of immediately receiving the finished image, they can assemble the mosaic and watch the photograph gradually appear. The process gives them time to discover the image in a new way and can even become something they do with another person.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This can be especially enjoyable during holidays, weekends, birthdays, or quiet evenings at home. The building process gives the recipient something to focus on while the finished mosaic gives them something to keep.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzVz3his-x_text","label":"ggzVz3his-x_text","default":"<p>A gift does not always have to make someone emotional. Sometimes making them laugh is even better.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The photograph that everyone in your family jokes about could become the perfect Memobrick. Maybe someone was caught making an incredible facial expression. Maybe your dog completely ruined a family photograph. Maybe your friend fell asleep somewhere they absolutely should not have.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those moments can make great keepsakes precisely because they are imperfect.</p><p>Years later, the photograph can still make people laugh, and having it transformed into a Memobrick gives everyone another reason to bring up the story.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0g4QSz3Qm_text","label":"gg0g4QSz3Qm_text","default":"For the Person Who Already Has Everything"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqdnyWPuN6_text","label":"ggqdnyWPuN6_text","default":"<p>Finding a gift for someone who seems to own everything can be frustrating. They may already have the gadgets they want, the clothes they like, and more household items than they need.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of trying to guess what object they are missing, think about what they already have that could be transformed into something personal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A photograph is a great starting point because it does not require you to guess their favorite brand, size, color, or style. You are choosing something connected to their own life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That makes a personalized Memobrick especially useful when shopping for someone who is difficult to buy for. You are not simply searching for another thing they might like. You are giving an existing memory a completely new form.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggomhSDqLq4_text","label":"ggomhSDqLq4_text","default":"<p>The photograph should also influence the size you choose. A close up image with one main subject may work well in a smaller format, while photographs with multiple people, pets, vehicles, or intricate backgrounds can benefit from a larger size.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For cars and motorcycles, larger options such as <strong>30x20 </strong>or <strong>40x30</strong> can provide more room for recognizable features and details. The right size can help the finished image communicate what made the original photograph special.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Think about the subject, the amount of detail, and where the recipient is likely to display the finished piece before choosing the size.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/da02321c-11c6-41ad-9234-90adabbdbd28.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_alt","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_alt","default":"Memobrick Racer Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_title","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_title","default":"Memobrick Racer Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4-G5CajDm_text","label":"gg4-G5CajDm_text","default":"<p>Some gifts are opened, appreciated, and eventually become part of the background.</p><p>Others make people stop and look twice.</p><p>They make someone recognize a photograph, remember a story, ask a question, or call someone over to take a look.</p><p>That is the kind of reaction a truly personal gift can create.</p><p>A Memobrick takes a photograph that already matters and gives it a new form that people can build, display, and talk about. Whether the image is sentimental, funny, adventurous, or simply something the recipient loves, the finished piece becomes a reason to revisit the story behind it.</p><p>And when someone looks at their gift and immediately wants to show it to everyone else, you know you found something special.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsewHDVlBH_text","label":"ggsewHDVlBH_text","default":"Honest Customer Review"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4yeexijwg_text","label":"gg4yeexijwg_text","default":"<p>Adam L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyE1w8i7SH_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggyE1w8i7SH_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Adam_L._This_was_the_best_valentine_s_gift_for_my_wife._We_enjoyed_putting_it_together._We_liked_it_so_much_we_sent_one_to_my_sister_of_her_dog_and_she_absolutely_loved_it._Thank_you.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyE1w8i7SH_alt","label":"ggyE1w8i7SH_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyE1w8i7SH_title","label":"ggyE1w8i7SH_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxB6ooWVM8_text","label":"ggxB6ooWVM8_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;This was the best valentine's gift for my wife. &nbsp;We enjoyed putting it together. We liked it so much we sent one to my sister of her dog and she absolutely loved it. Thank you!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg11d2AJjwb_text","label":"gg11d2AJjwb_text","default":"<p>Denise A</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpygXuvYBQ_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggpygXuvYBQ_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Denise_A._This_experience_was_wonderful_and_at_first_I_couldn_t_see_it_but_when_you_step_and_admire_it_you_can_the_photo_clearly..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpygXuvYBQ_alt","label":"ggpygXuvYBQ_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpygXuvYBQ_title","label":"ggpygXuvYBQ_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggznD6R8LqM_text","label":"ggznD6R8LqM_text","default":"<p>This experience was wonderful and at first I couldn’t see it, but when you step and admire it you can the photo clearly.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqznJ2mLCK_text","label":"ggqznJ2mLCK_text","default":"<p>Hilary S.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl-Gy2dreT_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggl-Gy2dreT_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Hilary_S._Super_easy_to_put_together._Comes_with_a_tool_to_use._But_I_placed_them_all_1_by_1._Reminded_me_alot_of_doing_diamond_art_pictures..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl-Gy2dreT_alt","label":"ggl-Gy2dreT_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl-Gy2dreT_title","label":"ggl-Gy2dreT_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMvyoU_XQU_text","label":"ggMvyoU_XQU_text","default":"<p>Super easy to put together. Comes with a tool to use. But I placed them all 1 by 1. Reminded me a lot of doing diamond art pictures.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiBfS11Yku_text","label":"ggiBfS11Yku_text","default":"<p>Lindsay W.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Lindsay_W._This_was_a_Christmas_present_for_my_husband_we_had_so_much_fun_putting_it_together_together._He_loved_the_end_result.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_alt","label":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_title","label":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMVg08QRSg_text","label":"ggMVg08QRSg_text","default":"<p>This was a Christmas present for my husband, we had so much fun putting it together, together. He loved the end result!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1zn5xrx2V_text","label":"gg1zn5xrx2V_text","default":"<p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_0","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_0","default":"<p>What kind of photograph should I turn into a Memobrick?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_1","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_1","default":"<p>Does the photograph need to be perfect?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_2","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_2","default":"<p>Can I give a Memobrick to someone who is difficult to shop for?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_3","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_3","default":"<p>What size should I choose?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6Bh6tsP-K_text","label":"gg6Bh6tsP-K_text","default":"<p>Choose a photograph that has meaning for the recipient. Family moments, pets, travel photographs, childhood pictures, hobbies, funny memories, cars, and motorcycles can all make great choices.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLojdV256l_text","label":"ggLojdV256l_text","default":"<p>No. Meaning is often more important than perfection. A candid or funny photograph can sometimes make a more memorable keepsake than a carefully posed picture.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1lfuZ-9YC_text","label":"gg1lfuZ-9YC_text","default":"<p>Yes. Since the gift is based on a photograph connected to the recipient, you do not have to guess their preferred style, brand, or interests in the same way you would with a generic product.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvI9Uf6sv4_text","label":"ggvI9Uf6sv4_text","default":"<p>Consider the number of subjects and amount of detail in your photograph. Larger sizes are often helpful for detailed images and subjects such as cars and motorcycles. Sizes such as 30x20 or 40x30 can provide more room for recognizable details.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewMoreText","label":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewMoreText","default":"Show more"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewLessText","label":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewLessText","default":"Show less"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLPDL01sbI_text","label":"ggLPDL01sbI_text","default":"Quantity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_label","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out of stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_unavailableLabel","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_successMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_errorMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPuZQwARXK_text","label":"ggPuZQwARXK_text","default":"<p>Hurry up! Sale <span style=\"color:#EA3335;\">20%</span>. Sale ends in:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_dayLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_dayLabel","default":"Days"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_hourLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_hourLabel","default":"Hrs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_minuteLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_minuteLabel","default":"Mins"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_secondLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_secondLabel","default":"Secs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_weekLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_weekLabel","default":"Weeks"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5